                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5aeb5efd-e446-377b-a00e-8fcb9dd94cee",
                        "entry_id": "d948a94c-14de-3ab8-bc97-3f2389bee659",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. весенний народный праздник в Италии, позднее в ряде других стран, сопровождающийся уличными шествиями, плясками, маскарадом и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "94ba1edf-19a1-40a7-b8ab-c6763ca92d95",
                                "sense_id": "5aeb5efd-e446-377b-a00e-8fcb9dd94cee",
                                "text": "Теперь в Париже самое шумное время — карнавал: балы за балами, спектакли великолепные. В последний день карнавала было такое множество народа, какого я никогда ещё не видывал. ❬…❭ Маски разных наций и костюмов перебегали беспрестанно по улицам."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "70cdb73f-91a8-3e97-9ad2-fe3357ad3974",
                        "entry_id": "d948a94c-14de-3ab8-bc97-3f2389bee659",
                        "glosses": [
                            "костюмированное народное гулянье, празднество с танцами, играми, маскарадом и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4434e1ca-40aa-4dc2-83fe-1d87b6d411af",
                                "sense_id": "70cdb73f-91a8-3e97-9ad2-fe3357ad3974",
                                "text": ".. народ едет веселиться в Парк культуры, где сегодня открывается блестящий карнавал."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e906c1c-d6e4-4eb9-9aa8-e27a1537922f",
                        "source_entry_id": "d948a94c-14de-3ab8-bc97-3f2389bee659",
                        "target_lang_word": "carnival",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "carnival",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2b33dce-72cb-3a03-b108-8d66cf63af95",
                                        "entry_id": "c30a18da-9a8a-354f-9382-37a897eb93bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of a number of festivals held just before the beginning of Lent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbb02894-af19-4a9c-9f6b-9b8cdf7ccad6",
                                                "sense_id": "a2b33dce-72cb-3a03-b108-8d66cf63af95",
                                                "text": "Carnival of Brazil"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "820d0914-bd0f-491f-924b-81dfacc167d1",
                                                "sense_id": "a2b33dce-72cb-3a03-b108-8d66cf63af95",
                                                "text": "Venice Carnival"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8bbda9a-e403-3888-baa5-e602d876ee90",
                                        "entry_id": "c30a18da-9a8a-354f-9382-37a897eb93bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A festive occasion marked by parades and sometimes special foods and other entertainment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37cd5feb-9e3f-4270-b83a-718140292d65",
                                                "sense_id": "c8bbda9a-e403-3888-baa5-e602d876ee90",
                                                "text": "Like most human activities, ballooning has sponsored heroes and hucksters and a good deal in between. For every dedicated scientist patiently recording atmospheric pressure and wind speed while shivering at high altitudes, there is a carnival barker with a bevy of pretty girls willing to dangle from a basket or parachute down to earth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fb7f525-6911-340d-b96f-1ffcacc1738a",
                                        "entry_id": "c30a18da-9a8a-354f-9382-37a897eb93bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A traveling amusement park, called a funfair in British English."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e851cd5-db2a-416f-aafb-813635a21ef9",
                                                "sense_id": "8fb7f525-6911-340d-b96f-1ffcacc1738a",
                                                "text": "We all got to ride the merry-go-round when they brought their carnival to town."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c9efd86-4807-4d72-9a5c-0b187a42ccf4",
                                                "sense_id": "8fb7f525-6911-340d-b96f-1ffcacc1738a",
                                                "text": "When the carnival came to town, every one wanted some cotton candy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc9bd0a8-5a56-3293-92fa-e87068b4d356",
                                        "entry_id": "c30a18da-9a8a-354f-9382-37a897eb93bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A context in which transgression or inversion of the social order is given temporary license. Derived from the work of Mikhail Bakhtin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd89ba64-40f6-43a9-bc0f-e9bf04c8adc9",
                                                "sense_id": "cc9bd0a8-5a56-3293-92fa-e87068b4d356",
                                                "text": "The social environment contains the ambiguous traces of carnival: it resists the ideology of capitalism and, at the same time, reproduces the capitalist social order."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb010b38-c84c-397c-a4f9-591b5363e0f6",
                                        "entry_id": "c30a18da-9a8a-354f-9382-37a897eb93bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A gaudily chaotic situation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e61194bb-e4c7-4092-9dd4-71b4acda5cf8",
                                                "sense_id": "eb010b38-c84c-397c-a4f9-591b5363e0f6",
                                                "text": "a carnival of idiocy"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "carnival",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13bbf405-d1f4-3b4e-a309-e36074aaac80",
                                        "entry_id": "ad65bdfd-fa55-3a63-ad27-3a21b3dc1430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To participate in a carnival."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0a0f496-c291-37b2-9a4b-599c231c63e9",
                                        "entry_id": "ad65bdfd-fa55-3a63-ad27-3a21b3dc1430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move about playfully or wildly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89c546be-5ce1-4464-a310-2a1637a7172d",
                                                "sense_id": "f0a0f496-c291-37b2-9a4b-599c231c63e9",
                                                "text": "The spot is a marvel of beauty and taste; and here, where dust and sun carnivaled for so many years, thousands of every class congregate to listen each evening to music discoursed for the amusement of oi polloi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb4ec22d-e018-4d74-803c-946a6e0f8e34",
                                                "sense_id": "f0a0f496-c291-37b2-9a4b-599c231c63e9",
                                                "text": "Sitting in the Chevy, Saturday night on Main Street carnivaling around her, she told herself that she understood, that Ross had made a mistake, had pre-arranged this celebration for tonight and thought that his date with her was tomorrow."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66ce988f-8085-4509-80ec-bc1b90ab5f68",
                                                "sense_id": "f0a0f496-c291-37b2-9a4b-599c231c63e9",
                                                "text": "A sudden bright white flash exploded before me. A kaleidoscope of silver lines drawn in rapid succession carnivalled in a blizzard of raging energy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6f9fa92c-ed81-470a-85d1-502fd115e9b4",
                        "source_entry_id": "d948a94c-14de-3ab8-bc97-3f2389bee659",
                        "target_lang_word": "carnaval",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "carnaval",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6765a30a-fe3d-3840-a77e-664e7ca5b033",
                                        "entry_id": "2fb5a86f-996c-30a3-8813-aaa8f163db01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Festival de costume et de couleur qui commence le jour des Rois et finit le mercredi des cendres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1fa2294-dc0e-4206-8c45-a3ef23728584",
                                                "sense_id": "6765a30a-fe3d-3840-a77e-664e7ca5b033",
                                                "text": "À la suite des bals masqués du carnaval de 1820, qui furent plus brillants que de coutume, la société de Milan vit éclater cinq ou six démarches complètement folles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5472064-4d06-4d0c-b0b7-33064f47c418",
                                                "sense_id": "6765a30a-fe3d-3840-a77e-664e7ca5b033",
                                                "text": "Le second dimanche avant le carnaval, il était de tradition pour les jeunes de bien s’amuser."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1f6a307-97a4-49f4-a278-6769068315df",
                                                "sense_id": "6765a30a-fe3d-3840-a77e-664e7ca5b033",
                                                "text": "La ville est toute illuminée. Une musique joue, la population est en fête. C'est le dimanche du carnaval. De fenêtres à fenêtres, à travers la rue, les gens se lancent des serpentins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfee8f38-b01c-4b77-97f5-3e77f0f781fe",
                                                "sense_id": "6765a30a-fe3d-3840-a77e-664e7ca5b033",
                                                "text": "À la Côte d’Azur, la vie est plus libre. Elles fréquentaient les bals, se mêlaient, masquées, aux fêtes du Carnaval ; elles prirent, l’une et l’autre un amant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e01991f5-f6a8-4eb6-bb94-ad9f3387321d",
                                                "sense_id": "6765a30a-fe3d-3840-a77e-664e7ca5b033",
                                                "text": "– Le Carnaval de Rio, je connais ça, dit-il. J'ai habité là-bas dix ans. C'est une fête de village comparé à la Sainte-Rosalie, une fête de pauvres."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bbde0ec-c6f3-32f8-9ce8-892ed7a6db0a",
                                        "entry_id": "2fb5a86f-996c-30a3-8813-aaa8f163db01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Festival de costume et de couleur qui commence le jour des Rois et finit le mercredi des cendres.",
                                            "Divertissement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cb94926-40db-4ce6-b536-d68eb30ba4b9",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbde0ec-c6f3-32f8-9ce8-892ed7a6db0a",
                                                "text": "Si vous étiez tombée sur un talent hypocrite, sur un railleur dont les livres sont mélancoliques et dont la vie est un carnaval continuel, vous auriez pu trouver au dénouement de votre sublime imprudence un méchant homme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfff86f6-32e8-340a-b8b3-e2f515ffaa2d",
                                        "entry_id": "2fb5a86f-996c-30a3-8813-aaa8f163db01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Festival de costume et de couleur qui commence le jour des Rois et finit le mercredi des cendres.",
                                            "Homme bizarrement accoutré."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94419f87-d4c8-458c-b079-0de90cb25cc6",
                                                "sense_id": "bfff86f6-32e8-340a-b8b3-e2f515ffaa2d",
                                                "text": "C’est un vrai carnaval."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
